    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "F901F810E7811ABE",
      "text": "Kieran changed a whole lot after he decided to\\nmix up his look. His personality took a nose dive,\\r\\nbut he looked darn cute...don’t you think?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
