    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "F901F710E781190B",
      "text": "My daddy’s a Gym Leader, you know, and he’s\\nawfully scary-looking.\\c\\nSo much so that boys tend to run the other way\\nwhen they learn I’m his daughter.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
